  "id": "fig-123",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Theorem 19 complete translation proof: parallel planes alpha and beta, perpendicular line a, intersections M and N, and the directed translation from M to N. Spatial perpendicularity and plane translation are checked by fig-123.geometry.mjs, not by projected screen angles.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-123.png",
